      "summary": "Discount Line Display – Order History",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see discounts that were applied to my order displayed in my order history, so that I can clearly see what savings were applied at the time of purchase.\nApplied discounts are displayed as individual read-only lines within the order summary on the order history page. Each line shows the promotion name, discount type, and saving amount. No remove option is available — this surface is view-only. This story is the order history counterpart to SFCC-192 (cart & checkout discount line display).",
