      "id": "19337",
      "key": "SFCC-833",
      "summary": "Payments – Retail Rewards Voucher Display in Checkout Order Summary",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want my Retail Rewards vouchers to be automatically applied and clearly displayed in my cart and checkout order summary, so that I can see my loyalty discounts before completing my purchase.\\n\\nThis is a placeholder story covering the display of Retail Rewards vouchers (e.g. Gold VIC Voucher) in the cart order summary and checkout order summary. Retail Rewards are automatically applied for eligible Gold and Platinum VIP customers via Omneo/AP21 — they are not manually entered by the customer.\\n\\nThis story covers two surfaces:\\n\\n1. Cart order summary — Retail Rewards voucher displayed as a named line item (e.g. \"Gold VIC Voucher\") with a Remove link and the discount amount shown (see SFCC-274). Note: currently explicitly out of scope in SFCC-274 — this story will define the behaviour and feed back into SFCC-274 once confirmed.\\n\\n2. Checkout order summary — Retail Rewards voucher displayed as a named line item in the checkout order summary with a Remove link and the discount amount shown.\\n\\nThis story is a draft — ACs to be written once the following open items are confirmed:\\n- How Retail Rewards are passed from Omneo/AP21 to SFCC at cart and checkout level\\n- Whether the customer can remove a Retail Rewards voucher from the cart/checkout\\n- How the voucher interacts with other discounts (promotional codes, gift cards)\\n- Whether Retail Rewards display in the cart is in scope for the initial launch or a phase 2 enhancement\\n\\nCross-dep: SFCC-75 (MuleSoft AP21 Retail Rewards as Payment), SFCC-274 (Cart Order Summary), Promotions epic (SFCC-87).\"",
