      "key": "SFCC-839",
      "summary": "Cart – Free Shipping Threshold BM Configuration (Per Storefront)",
      "description": "As a Site Admin, I want the free shipping threshold configured in SFCC Business Manager per storefront, so that the correct shipping cost is displayed in the cart order summary based on the Shopper's basket value.\nThis is a Business Manager configuration story covering the setup of the cart price rule threshold per storefront. The threshold determines whether the shipping cost displays as 0.00 (threshold met) or the configured shipping rate (threshold not met) against the default shipping method in the cart order summary.\nThe default shipping method configuration is covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-832\n \nNote: this story covers domestic markets only (AU, UK, EU domestic, US domestic). For international markets, shipping is handled by Global-e and is not configured here.\nConfirmed free shipping thresholds:\nAU — $750 AUD (recently increased from $500) - Express\nUK — £750 GBP (recently increased from £500) - Express\nEU — €750 EUR - Ground\nEU — €1000 EUR (recently increased from €500) - Express\nUS — $850 USD - Ground\nUS — $1200 USD (recently increased from $500) - Express",
