      "description": "As a Developer,\n\n\n I want a \nwishlist-login-panel\n content component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \n\n\nso that it renders the authentication prompt inside the \npdp/drawer\n (SFCC-736) when a logged-out shopper attempts to add an item to their wishlist.\nThe component covers the panel content only — the drawer shell, slide-in behaviour, overlay, and close trigger are owned by \npdp/drawer\n (SFCC-736). This component renders as children passed into that shell.\nThe panel content comprises three sections separated by dividers:\nEmail / OTP section — explanatory copy, email input field, and Send Code CTA\nSocial sign-in section — Sign in with Apple and Sign in with Google buttons\nNew account section — New to Zimmermann? heading, supporting copy, and Create an Account CTA\nAuthentication logic and API integration are out of scope for this story and are covered in the relevant auth stories.\nProp\nValues\nNotes\nsize\nLarge, Small, Mobile\nControls layout variant",
