      "description": "As a Shopper, \nI want to search by location in the Find in Boutique drawer and see boutique results ordered by proximity, \nso that I can quickly identify the nearest store for my selected item.\nThe Find in Boutique drawer (SFCC-740) renders inside pdp/drawer. This story covers the gap that was not covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-297\n .\nThe location search field behaviour (including default state), Google Maps Geocoding API integration to resolve the entered location into coordinates, and the use of SFCC store lat/long data to order results by distance from the customer. The results are list-based. \nReal-time stock availability is out of scope — covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-308\n .",
