      "id": "19432",
      "key": "SFCC-866",
      "summary": "Enhancement – Auto-Remove Cart Item When Moving to Wishlist if Item Already Exists in Wishlist",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want an item to be automatically removed from my cart when I move it to my wishlist, even if it already exists in my wishlist, so that I don't have to manually remove it after seeing an error message.\\n\\nThis enhancement was raised by Emma Kirwan following PO review of SFCC-272. Currently, SFCC OOTB behaviour (and Magento 2 behaviour) is to keep the item in the cart and display an error message when the customer attempts to move an item to their wishlist that already exists there. Emma's preference is that the item is automatically removed from the cart in this scenario, following the same behaviour as a standard Move to Wishlist action.\\n\\nThis requires custom PWA Kit development — it is not achievable with SFCC OOTB behaviour.\\n\\nCross-dep: SFCC-272 (Cart Item - Remove and Wishlist Actions).\"",
