      "description": "As a Developer, I want to build the Cart Summary Component as a PWA Kit component, so that the order totals, checkout actions, duties and taxes messaging, promotion code entry, and product recommendations are displayed consistently on the right-hand side of the cart drawer.\nThis is a \nPWA Kit UI component story\n — it covers the visual build and UI behaviour of the cart summary component only. It does not cover the logic, configuration, or integration behaviour of the elements it contains — these are owned by their respective epics and stories as noted below.\nUI Design Kit: \nhttps://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40003106-87796&t=IESHxrB28M8xoKIz-4\n \nThis is a PWA Kit component story covering the Cart Summary- the right-hand panel of the cart drawer. It acts as a container component that renders the following elements:\nOrder Summary - \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274\n \nButton Group - \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-275\n - note: logic for apple pay / google pay, and functionality will sit in payments\nDuties and Taxes Text - toggle configuration will be covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-826\n \nPromotion Code - \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-191\n \nRecommended for You - \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-815\n \nImage for Reference:",
