    {
      "id": "18551",
      "key": "SFCC-274",
      "summary": "Cart Page – Order Summary ",
      "description": "As\n a Shopper, \nI want\n to see a clear breakdown of my order costs in the cart, \nso that \nI understand the total before proceeding to checkout.\nThis story covers the UI and dynamic update behaviour of the order summary line items within the cart summary component \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274\n . The order summary is not a standalone component — it is a set of line items rendered within the cart summary component. No accessibility requirements are covered here — these are covered as part of the cart summary component.\nThe order summary displays the following line items: \nTotal Items\nShipping (domestic sites only)\nSubtotal\nTax (domestic sites only)\nGrand Total\nOut of Scope for this story: promotional lines in order summary, duties and taxes display.\nError Messages - when a cart error condition exists (e.g. fully OOS, partially OOS, unavailable item, max quantity reached), an error message is displayed in red within the order summary above the Checkout CTA. The specific error copy and trigger logic is defined in the respective stories. This story covers the display and resolution of the error message line item within the order summary only.\nShipping threshold configuration per storefront is covered in a separate BM config story — \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-832\n \nThere is no Avalara integration at cart.\nUI Kit: \nhttps://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40003189-103431&t=PLiAgkbn8XB5jhBa-0\n \nImage for reference (figma leading):\nStandard (and with error)\nWith Vouchers\nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/453902337/04.9+Cart+Order+Summary\n ",
