      "summary": "pdp/gallery",
      "description": "As a Developer, \n\n\nI want a reusable pdp/gallery React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \n\n\nso that it can be consumed by pdp/hero to render the product image and video gallery on the PDP.\nThe component renders a sequence of media items (photo and video) in a stacked layout on desktop and a swipeable carousel on mobile. The desktop layout adapts based on total media count. Video is treated as a standard media item and slots into the layout based on its position in the product's media array. The component renders a View Gallery button as a trigger only — the gallery overlay is a separate component and out of scope for this story.",
