      "key": "SFCC-378",
      "summary": "Payments – Klarna: Expanded State (Instalment Text & CTA)",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to pay using Klarna's buy now pay later service at checkout, so that I can split my payment into interest-free instalments.\\n\\nThis component represents the Klarna expanded state on the checkout payment step (Image 3). When selected the row expands to show: a dynamically calculated instalment text (e.g. \"4 interest free payments of $220\" based on the order total) and a \"Continue with Klarna\" branded CTA button. Payment is processed via Adyen/Klarna (SFCC-74). Available on AU and US storefronts (PAY-007). Error states: this component must handle Klarna failure and declined states gracefully (PAY-008) — displaying clear inline error messaging and allowing the customer to retry or select an alternative payment method without losing order data. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on PAY-007, PAY-008. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-74 (Adyen Payment Integration).",
