      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see my 3 most recent orders on my account dashboard, so that I can quickly check recent purchase activity without going to the full orders page.\\n\\nDisplays the 3 most recent orders on the My Account dashboard: order number, date placed, ship-to address, grand total, and status. \"View All\" link navigates to the full Orders page. Order data sourced from NewStore OMS via MuleSoft. Dependency: SFCC-57 (MuleSoft NewStore order integration). PWA Kit component.",
