      "key": "SFCC-365",
      "summary": "Order Confirmation – Order Summary Totals Block (Read-Only)",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see a read-only order totals summary on the confirmation page, so that I have a final record of what I was charged.\\n\\nThis component appears on the order confirmation page for both home delivery and Collect in Boutique variants (Images 3 and 5), below the order details block. It renders as a read-only list of order totals: Total Items, Shipping method and cost, Subtotal excl. GST, GST, and Grand Total. No edit functionality is available. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC order confirmation page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-068. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-65 (Avalara tax).",
