      "id": "18663",
      "key": "SFCC-329",
      "summary": "Checkout – Order Summary Panel",
      "description": "As a\n shopper,\n\n\nI want\n to see a summary of my order and costs throughout checkout,\n\n\nso that\n I can confirm what I'm purchasing and understand my total before completing my order.\nThis story covers the order summary panel rendered on the right-hand side of the checkout page across all checkout steps. It includes the line item list, totals breakdown, supporting accordions, and the \"Your purchase price may change\" footer copy. The panel is persistent across all checkout steps on desktop. On tablet and mobile the order summary is collapsed by default and expandable.\nOut of scope:\nCheckout item edit, remove, and wishlist actions — ⚠️ \nTBC whether customers can edit from checkout or must return to bag\nPromo code entry and validation — covered in SFCC-331\nGold VIC Voucher and Retail Rewards display — covered in SFCC-833\nTax line items (GST, Subtotal excl. GST) — covered in pricing epic\nDuties and taxes display and disclaimer — covered in SFCC-921\nAssistance, Shipping & Returns, and Secured Payments accordion content — Contentful-managed",
